		(uuid "4d20e884-fe93-4349-ad81-32cd5058b31a")
	)
	(text "R1205 (0.002 Ohm) drops 2 mV/A outside the feedback loop:\nV(CORE1V0) = 1.008 V - I x 0.002 Ohm, about 0.992 V at 8 A.\nR1206 (10 kOhm) provides a bleed path. PGR_CORE is open drain\nand R1202 (10 kOhm) pulls it to AON; it reports regulation before the\nshunt. Current limiting, hiccup and thermal protection are internal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "67d4d47d-7b69-40ab-b350-1809e352106e")
	)
	(text "1.008 V before the shunt.\nC1203: about 2.2 ms soft start."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 57 64.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
